WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.669 --> 00:00:03.919
(ocean waves crashing)

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:08.905
(speaking foreign language)

00:00:18.075 --> 00:00:20.908
(uplifting music)

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:28.470
- [Narrator] In Portugal,
the century-old craft

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:31.530
of canning fish is still
going strong today.

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:34.100
What simply started as a
method to preserve fish

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:37.490
in the nineteenth century has
turned into Portuguese art.

00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:40.020
Weaving together the old traditions

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:43.494
of fishing, canning and trading.

00:00:43.494 --> 00:00:47.244
(speaking foreign language)

